  "description": "Operating Area: Australia\n\nOur vessel, MV Great Escape accommodates 14 guests. Being one of the most exclusive luxury cruise vessels in the Kimberley, we offer true flexibility in itineraries. This means we can tailor cruises to suit your personal needs and interests. A vessel of our size can venture deeper into the Kimberley, allowing guests to experience the landscape in greater detail - accessing those “hard to navigate” places.\n\nWith a dedicated onboard helicopter available as an optional extra, we explore the Kimberley from another dimension. The helicopter provides you with access to remote waterfalls, ancient Indigenous art sites and “secret” landlocked fishing locations. ",
